v.003

- Increased the range on the GLS from 3000 to 5000 units;
- Lowered cooldown of the Shield skill from 5 to 3.5 seconds;
- Lowered cooldown of the PPPhaser skill from 5 to 3.5 seconds;
- Background changes for future updates;

v.002

- Added a silent walking mode, default keybind 'left shift';
- Added ragdoll physics after death in multiplayer;
- Improved visibility on the information text throughout the tutorial level;
- Fixed some text now showing up in the credits menu;
